# The Docker build context for the MCP server image (Dockerfile): only what the server
# needs at run time. Everything else stays out, including .git, node_modules, .env files
# and local project folders.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!LICENSE
!docs/DSL.md
!packages/
packages/**/node_modules
packages/**/*.o3j
# Last match wins, so these come after !packages/: secrets never enter the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
